## 1. 📌 PROJECT OVERVIEW

### What This Is

An **upgrade** to the existing Restaurant Admin Panel. We're adding subscription management, billing, notifications, and usage stats so restaurant owners can see and manage their own subscription without contacting support.

### Why We're Building It

- Restaurant owners need to see their subscription status
- They need to update payment methods themselves
- They need billing history
- They need trial countdown visibility
- They need to receive important notifications
- They need to see the value they're getting (usage stats)

### Relationship to Super Admin

| Component | Who Uses It | What It Does |
|-----------|-------------|--------------|
| **Super Admin Panel** | Platform owners | Manages all restaurants |
| **Restaurant Admin Panel** | Restaurant owners | Manages ONE restaurant + subscription |
| **User App** | Customers | Views menu |

All share the **SAME Supabase project**.

### Existing Repository

This upgrade goes into the **existing restaurant admin panel repository** — NOT a new project.

