## 4. 🗄️ NEW DATABASE TABLES

These tables already exist from the Super Admin PRD. The restaurant admin panel will **READ** from them (not create them).

### Tables Restaurant Admin Reads From

- `subscriptions` — Current subscription status
- `payment_transactions` — Payment history
- `system_notifications` — Notifications for this restaurant
- `restaurant_urls` — Custom URLs (read-only)

### Table Restaurant Admin Writes To

- `activity_logs` — Logs restaurant owner actions (read, not write)

### RLS Rules for Restaurant Admin

- Can SELECT their own subscription
- Can SELECT their own payment transactions
- Can SELECT their own notifications
- Can UPDATE notification `is_read` field
- Cannot INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE any subscription data
- Cannot modify payment records

