## 8. 💳 SUBSCRIPTION FLOW (Restaurant Owner's View)

### Complete Lifecycle

```
1. New Restaurant Signs Up
   ↓
2. 7-day Free Trial Starts
   ↓
3. Dashboard shows "Trial ending in X days"
   ↓
4. Day 4: Email + In-app notification
   ↓
5. Day 6: Email + In-app notification
   ↓
6. Day 7: Trial expires
   ↓
7. Restaurant owner sees "Subscribe Now" page
   ↓
8. Clicks Subscribe → Stripe Checkout opens
   ↓
9. Enters payment details
   ↓
10. Payment succeeds
    ↓
11. Status becomes Active
    ↓
12. Restaurant owner sees "Subscription Active"
    ↓
13. Every month: Stripe auto-charges
    ↓
14. Payment succeeds → status stays Active
    OR
15. Payment fails → status = Past Due
    ↓
16. Banner shows "Payment failed"
    ↓
17. Restaurant updates payment method
    ↓
18. Retry succeeds → status = Active
    OR
19. Still fails after 5 days → status = Suspended
    ↓
20. Menu goes offline
    ↓
21. Restaurant sees Payment Wall
    ↓
22. Renews → status = Active
    ↓
23. Everything reactivates
```

### Cancellation Flow

```
1. Restaurant clicks "Cancel Subscription"
   ↓
2. Confirmation modal opens
   ↓
3. Choose reason (dropdown)
4. Confirm cancellation
   ↓
5. Status = active, cancel_at_period_end = true
   ↓
6. Access continues until period end
   ↓
7. At period end: status = canceled
   ↓
8. Menu goes offline
   ↓
9. Restaurant can reactivate anytime
```

