## 9. 💰 PAYMENT FLOW

### Stripe Integration

- Restaurant admin uses **Stripe Customer Portal**
- Portal handles: card updates, invoice downloads, cancellation
- Our system redirects to portal via `stripe.billingPortal.sessions.create()`
- After portal, redirect back to subscription page

### Card Display Rules

**Show:**
- Card brand (Visa, Mastercard)
- Last 4 digits (•••• 4242)
- Expiry date (12/2027)

**Never show:**
- Full card number
- CVV
- Cardholder name (unless Stripe provides masked)

### Payment Method Updates

- Restaurant clicks "Update Payment Method"
- Redirects to Stripe portal
- Updates securely in Stripe
- Returns to subscription page
- Database updates automatically via webhook

### Invoices

- Every successful payment generates an invoice
- Accessible via Stripe
- Downloadable as PDF
- Available in billing history

